Error [E0205]: cannot edit `n` — `self` has read access only; write access (`~`) is required
  --> tests/ui/self_field_assign_not_mut.jet:5:14
    |
  5 |         self.n = self.n + 1
    |              ^
 Why: editing a field requires write access (`~`) on the owning place
 Fix: write the receiver as `~self` to grant write access
